														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1495342">
									

<p>It's supposed to be kind of silly in a way that's still inevitably dangerous. I figured if the Foundation saw one of its rivals dropping an anomalous object off outside one of its offices, the last thing it would do would be bring it inside and feed it. However, I thought that if the Serpent's Hand wanted to indicate real, absolute desperation, this would be a good way of doing it, and probably result in fewer overall casualties in the long run than keeping it around when it's turning people.</p>
<p>Plus, I thought it was creepy.</p>

